        <p>Treat the table as a routing tool. Find the row matching your buyer type, then read that profile below. Ranges reflect single-season casual pants programs in 180–400gsm woven and knit bottoms</p>

        <p><strong>MOQ and volume figures are market-observed ranges for each factory tier, not quotations from the named companies. Confirm directly with each supplier.</strong></p>

